# Which key signs what (docs/UPDATE.md, "Signatures"). One line each:
#     <what> <key name>
# <what> is "update" (ZeroOS updates) or an apps source exactly as
# apps.sources names it. <key name>.pem, the Ed25519 public key, sits next to
# this file. A line whose .pem isn't here yet does nothing: until the key is
# added (tools/signing-key.sh), these lists are taken unsigned, as before.
# Once it is, they must be signed, or the device refuses them.
update zeroos-release
hartj77-blip/CardPuter-Apps.4ME-U zeroos-release
hartj77-blip/CardPuter-OS.4ME-U zeroos-release
